{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"73c4e3226421fa9099ffa7e3becd4d8452e13a083d5791c9c10e53374d7c3fa4","digest":{"component_or_area":"outbound mapping / config layer","key_entities":["mapping_config.py:MappingLayer","config.py:effective_priority_map","config.py:effective_create_defaults","config.py:local_to_jira_priority","outbound_differ.py:_effective_priority_map_for","outbound_differ.py:_effective_create_defaults_for","outbound_mutation_builders.py","outbound_field_diff.py:compute_update_fields","resolve_outbound_priority","value_maps.py:LOCAL_PRIORITY_TO_JIRA","_backend.py:OutboundMapper.map_local_to_remote","adapters/jira/outbound_fields.py:_map_local_to_jira_fields","adapters/jira_datacenter/backend.py:_map_local_to_dc_fields"],"problem_keywords":["priority mapping","config-driven","per-project defaults","soft field","drift handling","create fields"],"propositions":["Priority mapping must be config-driven via str-keyed per-project priority_map axis in MappingLayer, mirroring the S2 status_map pattern with optional threading through CREATE and UPDATE carriers.","Unmapped priority values must drift gracefully (omit field, warn once, do not fail sync) rather than defaulting to a fallback value.","create_defaults must be a str-valued per-project axis applied only to CREATE operations, merged after baseline computed fields so baseline fields win on collision.","New resolvers _effective_priority_map_for and _effective_create_defaults_for must extract config per ticket in outbound_differ, symmetric to existing _effective_status_map_for.","Config layer must re-declare priority name literals in-module as local_to_jira_priority dict without importing value_maps, and parity-test against built-in int-keyed dict.","Protocol signatures for map_local_to_remote and map_fields_to_remote must add optional priority_map and create_defaults kwargs with None defaults, preserving backward compatibility with existing test doubles."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787678390608835001,"uuid":"f14473ad-2259-4718-a0b5-6245bde199dc"}